PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md
.impeccable/

# ===== OS / Office junk files =====
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
~$*

# QA upload test pictures (~60 MB): kept on each tester's machine, not in Git
database/test-upload/

# Archive sample paintings (~450 MB): downloaded by database/seed-images/nga/fetch-images.ps1, not in Git
database/seed-images/nga/images/

# JWT signing key generated for the mobile API (Infrastructure/Api/ApiSetup.cs) – never commit
src/InstituteOfFineArts.Web/App_Data/
